<title>RUSSIA: Russian Q1 vehicle output rises 13 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russian Q1 vehicle output rises 13 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia produced 267,000 vehicles in the first quarter of this year, a 13 percent rise on year-ago levels, State Statistics Commitee figures showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN VEHICLE OUTPUT	    Q1 '97    Q1 '96</p>
<p>							   pct yr/yr</p>
<p>							    change</p>
<p>    total production of vehicles   267,000     +13</p>
<p>    total production trucks	   33,200     -03</p>
<p>    total production cars	    224,000     +16</p>
<p>    total production buses	     9,500     +03</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
